@* 新建游戏表单：复刻原版 CS 1.6 的新建游戏对话框。
   cstrike\resource\GameMenu.res 里 "New Game" 的命令是 OpenCreateMultiplayerGameDialog，
   即 GameUI.dll 的 CCreateMultiplayerGameDialog，只有两页：
   - 服务器（#GameUI_Server）：Resource/CreateMultiplayerGameServerPage.res。
     MapList 下拉 + 服务器名称 / 服务器密码 / 最大玩家数量 / Enable Steam Networking；
     res 里的 EnableBotsCheck、BotQuotaCombo、SkillLevel* 在 cstrike 中都是 visible=0，
     所以界面上根本不出现（那些控件是给 CZ 的 res 打开用的）。
   - 游戏（#GameUI_Game）：settings.scr 的 DESCRIPTION SERVER_OPTIONS，按文件顺序生成
     除前三项（hostname/maxplayers/sv_password，已在服务器页）之外的 15 项。
   原版没有 Bot 页：GameUI.dll 用 _stricmp(ModData 的 game 标题, "Condition Zero") 判断，
   只有 CZ 才 new CCreateMultiplayerGameBotPage 并 AddPage("BotPage" / #GameUI_CPUPlayerOptions)，
   CS 1.6（game "Counter-Strike"）直接跳过（0x1001ED3E jne 0x1001ED89）。
   控件类型按原版语义：STRING→文本框、NUMBER 有界→滑条、NUMBER 无界（-1 上限）→数字框、
   BOOL→复选框、LIST→下拉。文案取自 cstrike_schinese / gameui_schinese 的官方译文。
   启动时按原版流程下发：引擎侧参数（maxplayers/hostname/sv_password/sv_lan）→ map 开局 →
   两个 wait（0x1F488 原版同款）→ mp_*（mp.dll 随服务器才加载，提前下发会被当 unknown 丢弃）。
   记忆机制（反汇编确认）：原版对话框进程内常驻（首次打开 new，之后只重新激活），
   且开局时把控件值整文件重写回 settings.scr（文件头自述 "stores last settings chosen,
   too"；引擎不持久化这些值——hostname/mp_* 均非 FCVAR_ARCHIVE 不进 config.cfg），
   下次创建对话框时按条目回读。这里用 settings.scr 往返（SettingsScr）+ 进程内
   static 等价实现，与原版互认同一个文件。
   地图：原版 CS 1.6 不跨重启保存（唯一写 CSBotConfig.vdf "map" 的是 CZ 分支），
   这里补上写侧——开局时把 map 写进 cstrike\CSBotConfig.vdf（BotConfigVdf），
   正好复活的是原版构造函数里自己的恢复路径（0x1EEECC 读 "map" 键），原版 UI 可直接读回。
   Enable Steam Networking 复选框同用这份文件（键 "steamnetworking"）：settings.scr 的
   SERVER_OPTIONS 里没有它，而 cvar sv_use_steam_networking 只有新引擎注册（Steam 版
   hw.dll/sw.dll；3266 整套安装里没有任何模块注册它），cvar 当不了跨重启存储。
   初值优先取这份存档，其次 cvar 当前值，都没有才默认开。
   随机地图：原版下拉第一项是 #GameUI_RandomMap（"< Random Map >"），Start 时
   ServerPage::GetMapString（0x206B0）检测到该选中项就在真实地图里均匀随机取一张，
   选中态本身不变（常驻对话框继续显示随机地图）；本表单同款实现。
   机器人（第 3 页"机器人"）：原版把 bot 项留在两个地方——服务器页 res 的
   EnableBotsCheck/BotQuotaCombo/SkillLevel*（3266 的 res 里 visible=1，Steam 的同名
   res 里全被置 0），以及只有 CZ 才构造的 CCreateMultiplayerGameBotPage（对话框构造
   函数里 _stricmp(ModData 的 game 标题, "Condition Zero") 不成立就跳过整页）。
   控件背后那批 cvar 是真能用的：cstrike\dlls\mp.dll 带着完整 CZ bot 模块
   （bot_quota / bot_difficulty / bot_join_team="any" / bot_chatter="normal" /
   bot_prefix / bot_join_after_player / bot_auto_vacate / bot_defer_to_human /
   bot_allow_*，两套安装的 mp.dll 都有）。这里按 CZ bot 页的项做成独立标签页，
   下拉值用服务器认的字面量，bot_quota 最后下发让服务器按已生效的设置补满名额。
   bot_* 与 mp_* 一样要等 map 之后才注册，走同一批 wait；跨重启记忆仍写
   CSBotConfig.vdf（键名 = cvar 名）。#Cstrike_Bot_* 这批 token 两套安装的 cstrike
   本地化里都没有（原版只显示裸键名），文案直接给中文。
   注：bot 靠 maps\<地图>.nav 寻路——3266 附了 19 个 nav，Steam 版一个都没有，
   那种图上加了机器人也不会走位；按要求照常下发、不额外提示。 *@
<Border Background="@("#161D26")" CornerRadius="12"
        BorderBrush="@("#2A3644")" BorderThickness="1"
        Padding="@("20,12")" Margin="20">
	<Grid RowDefinitions="@("*,Auto")">
		<TabControl Grid.Row="0" T="TabItem" Margin="@("0,4,0,0")">

			<TabItem Header="@("服务器")">
				<ScrollViewer>
					<StackPanel Spacing="12" Margin="@("16,16")">
						<StackPanel Orientation="Orientation.Horizontal" Spacing="12">
							<TextBlock Text="地图" Width="120" VerticalAlignment="VerticalAlignment.Center"
							           Foreground="@("#C6D2DD")" />
							<ComboBox T="string" ItemsSource="@_mapChoices" OnSelectionChanged="OnMapSelected"
							          SelectedIndex="@_mapIndex" Width="360" MaxDropDownHeight="300" />
						</StackPanel>

						<StackPanel Orientation="Orientation.Horizontal" Spacing="12">
							<TextBlock Text="服务器名称" Width="120" VerticalAlignment="VerticalAlignment.Center"
							           Foreground="@("#C6D2DD")" />
							<TextBox @bind-Text="_hostname" Width="320" />
						</StackPanel>

						<StackPanel Orientation="Orientation.Horizontal" Spacing="12">
							<TextBlock Text="服务器密码" Width="120" VerticalAlignment="VerticalAlignment.Center"
							           Foreground="@("#C6D2DD")" />
							<TextBox @bind-Text="_password" Width="320" />
						</StackPanel>

						<StackPanel Orientation="Orientation.Horizontal" Spacing="12">
							<TextBlock Text="最大玩家数量" Width="120" VerticalAlignment="VerticalAlignment.Center"
							           Foreground="@("#C6D2DD")" />
							<Slider Minimum="1" Maximum="32" Width="220" @bind-Value="_maxPlayers" />
							<TextBlock Text="@MaxPlayersText" Width="32" VerticalAlignment="VerticalAlignment.Center"
							           Foreground="@("#C6D2DD")" />
						</StackPanel>

						@* 原版是单个 CheckButton（labelText = #Valve_Enable_SteamNetworking），无独立标签 *@
						<CheckBox @bind-IsChecked="_steamNetworking">Enable Steam Networking</CheckBox>
					</StackPanel>
				</ScrollViewer>
			</TabItem>

			<TabItem Header="@("游戏")">
				<ScrollViewer>
					<StackPanel Spacing="12" Margin="@("16,16")">
						@* 顺序与 settings.scr 的 DESCRIPTION SERVER_OPTIONS 完全一致；
						   hostname / maxplayers / sv_password 三项已在服务器页，这里不重复 *@
						<StackPanel Orientation="Orientation.Horizontal" Spacing="12">
							<TextBlock Text="每张地图时间 (分钟)" Width="180" VerticalAlignment="VerticalAlignment.Center"
							           Foreground="@("#C6D2DD")" />
							<TextBox @bind-Text="_timelimit" Width="100" />
						</StackPanel>

						<StackPanel Orientation="Orientation.Horizontal" Spacing="12">
							<TextBlock Text="获胜限制 (局)" Width="180" VerticalAlignment="VerticalAlignment.Center"
							           Foreground="@("#C6D2DD")" />
							<TextBox @bind-Text="_winlimit" Width="100" />
						</StackPanel>

						<StackPanel Orientation="Orientation.Horizontal" Spacing="12">
							<TextBlock Text="局数限制 (局)" Width="180" VerticalAlignment="VerticalAlignment.Center"
							           Foreground="@("#C6D2DD")" />
							<TextBox @bind-Text="_maxrounds" Width="100" />
						</StackPanel>

						<StackPanel Orientation="Orientation.Horizontal" Spacing="12">
							<TextBlock Text="每一局的时间 (分钟)" Width="180" VerticalAlignment="VerticalAlignment.Center"
							           Foreground="@("#C6D2DD")" />
							<Slider Minimum="0" Maximum="15" Width="220" @bind-Value="_roundtime" />
							<TextBlock Text="@RoundTimeText" Width="32" VerticalAlignment="VerticalAlignment.Center"
							           Foreground="@("#C6D2DD")" />
						</StackPanel>

						<StackPanel Orientation="Orientation.Horizontal" Spacing="12">
							<TextBlock Text="静止时间 (秒)" Width="180" VerticalAlignment="VerticalAlignment.Center"
							           Foreground="@("#C6D2DD")" />
							<Slider Minimum="0" Maximum="60" Width="220" @bind-Value="_freezetime" />
							<TextBlock Text="@FreezeTimeText" Width="32" VerticalAlignment="VerticalAlignment.Center"
							           Foreground="@("#C6D2DD")" />
						</StackPanel>

						<StackPanel Orientation="Orientation.Horizontal" Spacing="12">
							<TextBlock Text="购买时间 (分钟)" Width="180" VerticalAlignment="VerticalAlignment.Center"
							           Foreground="@("#C6D2DD")" />
							<TextBox @bind-Text="_buytime" Width="100" />
						</StackPanel>

						<StackPanel Orientation="Orientation.Horizontal" Spacing="12">
							<TextBlock Text="起始金钱" Width="180" VerticalAlignment="VerticalAlignment.Center"
							           Foreground="@("#C6D2DD")" />
							<Slider Minimum="800" Maximum="16000" Width="220" @bind-Value="_startmoney" />
							<TextBlock Text="@StartMoneyText" Width="52" VerticalAlignment="VerticalAlignment.Center"
							           Foreground="@("#C6D2DD")" />
						</StackPanel>

						<CheckBox @bind-IsChecked="_footsteps">脚步</CheckBox>

						<StackPanel Orientation="Orientation.Horizontal" Spacing="12">
							<TextBlock Text="死亡视角模式" Width="180" VerticalAlignment="VerticalAlignment.Center"
							           Foreground="@("#C6D2DD")" />
							<ComboBox T="string" ItemsSource="@CameraLabels" OnSelectionChanged="OnCameraSelected"
							          SelectedIndex="@_cameraIndex" Width="260" />
						</StackPanel>

						<CheckBox @bind-IsChecked="_fadetoblack">禁用追逐/死亡视角</CheckBox>
						<CheckBox @bind-IsChecked="_friendlyFire">是否能够伤害</CheckBox>
						<CheckBox @bind-IsChecked="_tkpunish">在下一局中杀死团队杀手</CheckBox>
						<CheckBox @bind-IsChecked="_autokick">踢出懒惰者和团队杀手</CheckBox>

						<StackPanel Orientation="Orientation.Horizontal" Spacing="12">
							<TextBlock Text="踢出杀死(x)个人质的玩家" Width="180" VerticalAlignment="VerticalAlignment.Center"
							           Foreground="@("#C6D2DD")" />
							<TextBox @bind-Text="_hostagepenalty" Width="100" />
						</StackPanel>

						<CheckBox @bind-IsChecked="_flashlight">允许手电筒</CheckBox>
					</StackPanel>
				</ScrollViewer>
			</TabItem>

			<TabItem Header="@("机器人")">
				<ScrollViewer>
					<StackPanel Spacing="12" Margin="@("16,16")">
						<StackPanel Orientation="Orientation.Horizontal" Spacing="12">
							<TextBlock Text="机器人数量" Width="180" VerticalAlignment="VerticalAlignment.Center"
							           Foreground="@("#C6D2DD")" />
							<Slider Minimum="0" Maximum="32" Width="220" @bind-Value="_botQuota" />
							<TextBlock Text="@BotQuotaText" Width="32" VerticalAlignment="VerticalAlignment.Center"
							           Foreground="@("#C6D2DD")" />
						</StackPanel>

						<StackPanel Orientation="Orientation.Horizontal" Spacing="12">
							<TextBlock Text="机器人难度" Width="180" VerticalAlignment="VerticalAlignment.Center"
							           Foreground="@("#C6D2DD")" />
							<ComboBox T="string" ItemsSource="@DifficultyLabels" OnSelectionChanged="OnDifficultySelected"
							          SelectedIndex="@_difficultyIndex" Width="260" />
						</StackPanel>

						<StackPanel Orientation="Orientation.Horizontal" Spacing="12">
							<TextBlock Text="加入队伍" Width="180" VerticalAlignment="VerticalAlignment.Center"
							           Foreground="@("#C6D2DD")" />
							<ComboBox T="string" ItemsSource="@TeamLabels" OnSelectionChanged="OnTeamSelected"
							          SelectedIndex="@_teamIndex" Width="260" />
						</StackPanel>

						<StackPanel Orientation="Orientation.Horizontal" Spacing="12">
							<TextBlock Text="无线电语音" Width="180" VerticalAlignment="VerticalAlignment.Center"
							           Foreground="@("#C6D2DD")" />
							<ComboBox T="string" ItemsSource="@ChatterLabels" OnSelectionChanged="OnChatterSelected"
							          SelectedIndex="@_chatterIndex" Width="260" />
						</StackPanel>

						<StackPanel Orientation="Orientation.Horizontal" Spacing="12">
							<TextBlock Text="机器人名字前缀" Width="180" VerticalAlignment="VerticalAlignment.Center"
							           Foreground="@("#C6D2DD")" />
							<TextBox @bind-Text="_botPrefix" Width="320" />
						</StackPanel>

						<CheckBox @bind-IsChecked="_botJoinAfterPlayer">玩家加入后机器人再进场</CheckBox>
						<CheckBox @bind-IsChecked="_botAutoVacate">玩家不足时机器人自动让位</CheckBox>
						<CheckBox @bind-IsChecked="_botDeferToHuman">机器人让出装备给玩家</CheckBox>

						<TextBlock Text="允许机器人使用" Foreground="@("#8FA0A8")" Margin="@("0,8,0,0")" />
						<CheckBox @bind-IsChecked="_botAllowPistols">手枪</CheckBox>
						<CheckBox @bind-IsChecked="_botAllowShotguns">霰弹枪</CheckBox>
						<CheckBox @bind-IsChecked="_botAllowSubMachineGuns">冲锋枪</CheckBox>
						<CheckBox @bind-IsChecked="_botAllowRifles">步枪</CheckBox>
						<CheckBox @bind-IsChecked="_botAllowMachineGuns">机枪</CheckBox>
						<CheckBox @bind-IsChecked="_botAllowSnipers">狙击枪</CheckBox>
						<CheckBox @bind-IsChecked="_botAllowGrenades">手雷</CheckBox>
						<CheckBox @bind-IsChecked="_botAllowShield">盾牌</CheckBox>
						<CheckBox @bind-IsChecked="_botAllowRogues">允许背叛队友</CheckBox>
					</StackPanel>
				</ScrollViewer>
			</TabItem>

		</TabControl>

		<StackPanel Grid.Row="1" Orientation="Orientation.Horizontal"
		            HorizontalAlignment="HorizontalAlignment.Right" Margin="12">
			<Button OnClick="Start" Width="110" Height="34"
			        Background="@("#4FA3E3")" Foreground="@("#0B1016")">开始</Button>
		</StackPanel>
	</Grid>
</Border>

@code {
	// —— 地图 ——
	// ImmutableArray 走 Blazonia 的 IImmutableList 直接赋值路径（ItemsSource 在具名参数
	// 阶段先于 SelectedIndex 应用）；List 会走 ObservableCollection 包装、渲染阶段才应用，
	// 导致 SelectedIndex 先写入被清空、下拉框显示为空
	// _maps 为真实地图；_mapChoices 是下拉项：第一项"< 随机地图 >"（原版 #GameUI_RandomMap，
	// "< Random Map >"，恒为第 0 项）+ 真实地图
	const string RandomMapChoice = "< 随机地图 >";
	ImmutableArray<string> _maps = ImmutableArray<string>.Empty;
	ImmutableArray<string> _mapChoices = ImmutableArray<string>.Empty;
	string? _selectedMap;
	int _mapIndex;

	// 与原版一致：CreateMultiplayerGameDialog 进程内只创建一次（之后只重新激活），
	// 地图下拉因此记住上次选择（可能就是"随机地图"这一项）；settings.scr 不存地图，
	// 用进程内 static 等价实现
	static string? s_lastMap;

	// —— 服务器（Server 页）——
	string _hostname = "Counter-Strike Server";
	string _password = "";
	double? _maxPlayers = 16;
	bool? _steamNetworking = true;

	// —— 游戏选项（settings.scr / DESCRIPTION SERVER_OPTIONS 顺序）——
	string _timelimit = "20";
	string _winlimit = "0";
	string _maxrounds = "0";
	double? _roundtime = 5;
	double? _freezetime = 6;
	string _buytime = "1.5";
	double? _startmoney = 800;
	bool? _footsteps = true;
	int _cameraIndex;
	bool? _fadetoblack = false;
	bool? _friendlyFire = false;
	bool? _tkpunish = true;
	bool? _autokick = false;
	string _hostagepenalty = "5";
	bool? _flashlight = false;

	// —— 机器人（原版 CreateMultiplayerGameBotPage.res + 服务器页的 bot 控件）——
	// 这些 cvar 全部由 cstrike\dlls\mp.dll 注册（两套安装的 mp.dll 都带完整 CZ bot
	// 模块：0x115e48 起一段 bot_chatter="normal" / bot_join_team="any" /
	// bot_allow_*="1" / bot_prefix / bot_quota / bot_difficulty …），
	// 所以和 mp_* 一样必须等 map 之后才存在
	double? _botQuota = 0;
	int _difficultyIndex = 1;
	int _teamIndex;
	int _chatterIndex = 2;
	string _botPrefix = "";
	bool? _botJoinAfterPlayer = true;
	bool? _botAutoVacate = true;
	bool? _botDeferToHuman = true;
	bool? _botAllowPistols = true;
	bool? _botAllowShotguns = true;
	bool? _botAllowSubMachineGuns = true;
	bool? _botAllowRifles = true;
	bool? _botAllowMachineGuns = true;
	bool? _botAllowSnipers = true;
	bool? _botAllowGrenades = true;
	bool? _botAllowShield = true;
	bool? _botAllowRogues = true;

	// LIST 项文案取自 settings.scr 的 token（#Cstrike_Spectate_Anyone 等）官方简体中文
	static readonly ImmutableArray<string> CameraLabels =
		new[] { "所有人观看", "只分组观看", "只允许第一人称视角" }.ToImmutableArray();

	// 机器人下拉：文案对应原版 res 的 #Cstrike_Bot_Difficulty0..3、
	// #CStrike_Bot_JoinTeam、#Cstrike_Bot_Chatter 各项（两套安装的 cstrike 本地化里
	// 都没有这批 token，原版界面只显示裸键名，这里给中文）；值用服务器认的字面量
	static readonly ImmutableArray<string> DifficultyLabels =
		new[] { "新手", "普通", "困难", "专家" }.ToImmutableArray();
	static readonly ImmutableArray<string> TeamLabels =
		new[] { "任意", "CT", "恐怖分子" }.ToImmutableArray();
	static readonly ImmutableArray<string> TeamValues =
		new[] { "any", "ct", "terrorist" }.ToImmutableArray();
	static readonly ImmutableArray<string> ChatterLabels =
		new[] { "关闭", "简短", "正常", "电台" }.ToImmutableArray();
	static readonly ImmutableArray<string> ChatterValues =
		new[] { "off", "minimal", "normal", "radio" }.ToImmutableArray();

	string MaxPlayersText => ((int)Math.Round(_maxPlayers ?? 16)).ToString();
	string RoundTimeText => ((int)Math.Round(_roundtime ?? 5)).ToString();
	string FreezeTimeText => ((int)Math.Round(_freezetime ?? 6)).ToString();
	string StartMoneyText => ((int)Math.Round(_startmoney ?? 800)).ToString();
	string BotQuotaText => ((int)Math.Round(_botQuota ?? 0)).ToString();

	protected override void OnInitialized()
	{
		LoadMaps();
		// 与原版一致：控件初值取 settings.scr 存储的上次设置（原版对话框创建时按条目回读；
		// 引擎不持久化 hostname/mp_*——均非 FCVAR_ARCHIVE 不进 config.cfg，也不写 game.cfg，
		// settings.scr 是唯一跨重启存储）。主菜单阶段 mp.dll 未加载、mp_* cvar 不存在，
		// cvar 读取只能作为已开局时的候选，排在 settings.scr 之后
		_hostname = SettingsScr.GetValue("hostname") ?? EngineCommands.GetCvarString("hostname", "Counter-Strike Server");
		_password = SettingsScr.GetValue("sv_password") ?? EngineCommands.GetCvarString("sv_password");
		_maxPlayers = ScrFloat("maxplayers", EngineCommands.GetCvarFloat("maxplayers", 16));
		if (_maxPlayers < 1 || _maxPlayers > 32)
			_maxPlayers = 16;
		_steamNetworking = StoredBool(BotConfigVdf.GetValue("steamnetworking"))
			?? EngineCommands.GetCvarFloat("sv_use_steam_networking", 1) != 0;
		_timelimit = NumText(ScrFloat("mp_timelimit", EngineCommands.GetCvarFloat("mp_timelimit", 20)));
		_winlimit = NumText(ScrFloat("mp_winlimit", EngineCommands.GetCvarFloat("mp_winlimit", 0)));
		_maxrounds = NumText(ScrFloat("mp_maxrounds", EngineCommands.GetCvarFloat("mp_maxrounds", 0)));
		_roundtime = Clamp(ScrFloat("mp_roundtime", EngineCommands.GetCvarFloat("mp_roundtime", 5)), 0, 15);
		_freezetime = Clamp(ScrFloat("mp_freezetime", EngineCommands.GetCvarFloat("mp_freezetime", 6)), 0, 60);
		_buytime = NumText(ScrFloat("mp_buytime", EngineCommands.GetCvarFloat("mp_buytime", 1.5f)));
		_startmoney = Clamp(ScrFloat("mp_startmoney", EngineCommands.GetCvarFloat("mp_startmoney", 800)), 800, 16000);
		_footsteps = ScrFloat("mp_footsteps", EngineCommands.GetCvarFloat("mp_footsteps", 1)) != 0;
		_cameraIndex = (int)Clamp(ScrFloat("mp_forcecamera", EngineCommands.GetCvarFloat("mp_forcecamera", 0)), 0, 2);
		_fadetoblack = ScrFloat("mp_fadetoblack", EngineCommands.GetCvarFloat("mp_fadetoblack", 0)) != 0;
		_friendlyFire = ScrFloat("mp_friendlyfire", EngineCommands.GetCvarFloat("mp_friendlyfire", 0)) != 0;
		_tkpunish = ScrFloat("mp_tkpunish", EngineCommands.GetCvarFloat("mp_tkpunish", 1)) != 0;
		_autokick = ScrFloat("mp_autokick", EngineCommands.GetCvarFloat("mp_autokick", 0)) != 0;
		_hostagepenalty = NumText(ScrFloat("mp_hostagepenalty", EngineCommands.GetCvarFloat("mp_hostagepenalty", 5)));
		_flashlight = ScrFloat("mp_flashlight", EngineCommands.GetCvarFloat("mp_flashlight", 0)) != 0;
		// 机器人：初值取 CSBotConfig.vdf（键名就是对应 cvar 名），其次已开局时的 cvar
		// 当前值，都没有按 mp.dll 注册时的默认值；默认数量 0 = 不加机器人
		_botQuota = StoredInt("bot_quota", 0, 0, 32);
		_difficultyIndex = StoredInt("bot_difficulty", 1, 0, 3);
		_teamIndex = IndexOfValue(TeamValues, StoredOrCvar("bot_join_team"), 0);
		_chatterIndex = IndexOfValue(ChatterValues, StoredOrCvar("bot_chatter"), 2);
		_botPrefix = StoredOrCvar("bot_prefix");
		_botJoinAfterPlayer = StoredFlag("bot_join_after_player", true);
		_botAutoVacate = StoredFlag("bot_auto_vacate", true);
		_botDeferToHuman = StoredFlag("bot_defer_to_human", true);
		_botAllowPistols = StoredFlag("bot_allow_pistols", true);
		_botAllowShotguns = StoredFlag("bot_allow_shotguns", true);
		_botAllowSubMachineGuns = StoredFlag("bot_allow_sub_machine_guns", true);
		_botAllowRifles = StoredFlag("bot_allow_rifles", true);
		_botAllowMachineGuns = StoredFlag("bot_allow_machine_guns", true);
		_botAllowSnipers = StoredFlag("bot_allow_snipers", true);
		_botAllowGrenades = StoredFlag("bot_allow_grenades", true);
		_botAllowShield = StoredFlag("bot_allow_shield", true);
		_botAllowRogues = StoredFlag("bot_allow_rogues", true);
	}

	/// <summary>机器人项初值：vdf 存档 → cvar 当前值（没存档且已开局时）→ 默认值，并夹到合法区间</summary>
	int StoredInt(string cvar, int fallback, int min, int max)
	{
		var stored = BotConfigVdf.GetValue(cvar);
		var v = int.TryParse(stored, out var n) ? n : (int)Math.Round(EngineCommands.GetCvarFloat(cvar, fallback));
		return (int)Clamp(v, min, max);
	}

	bool StoredFlag(string cvar, bool fallback) =>
		StoredBool(BotConfigVdf.GetValue(cvar)) ?? EngineCommands.GetCvarFloat(cvar, fallback ? 1 : 0) != 0;

	/// <summary>字符串项：空值（cvar 不存在时引擎返回空）按没有处理</summary>
	string StoredOrCvar(string cvar)
	{
		var stored = BotConfigVdf.GetValue(cvar);
		if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(stored))
			return stored;
		return EngineCommands.GetCvarString(cvar, "");
	}

	static int IndexOfValue(ImmutableArray<string> values, string? stored, int fallback)
	{
		var i = string.IsNullOrEmpty(stored) ? -1 : values.IndexOf(stored!, StringComparer.OrdinalIgnoreCase);
		return i < 0 ? fallback : i;
	}

	/// <summary>settings.scr 存储值解析（原版对话框 Game 页的初值来源）；缺失/非法时用回退值</summary>
	static float ScrFloat(string cvar, float fallback)
	{
		var s = SettingsScr.GetValue(cvar);
		return s != null
			&& float.TryParse(s, System.Globalization.NumberStyles.Float,
				System.Globalization.CultureInfo.InvariantCulture, out var v) ? v : fallback;
	}

	static string NumText(float v) => v.ToString("0.####", System.Globalization.CultureInfo.InvariantCulture);
	static double Clamp(float v, double min, double max) => Math.Min(max, Math.Max(min, v));
	/// <summary>存档里的 0/1 布尔；缺失或不是 0/1 时返回 null，让调用方继续往下找别的来源</summary>
	static bool? StoredBool(string? v) => v == "1" ? true : v == "0" ? false : null;
	static float ParseNum(string? s, float fallback) =>
		float.TryParse(s, System.Globalization.NumberStyles.Float,
			System.Globalization.CultureInfo.InvariantCulture, out var v) && v >= 0 ? v : fallback;

	/// <summary>枚举 mod 目录下 maps\*.bsp（地图名去掉扩展名，按名称排序）</summary>
	void LoadMaps()
	{
		try
		{
			var gameDir = EngineCommands.GetGameDirectory();
			if (gameDir == null)
				return;
			var list = Directory.GetFiles(Path.Combine(gameDir, "maps"), "*.bsp")
				.Select(Path.GetFileNameWithoutExtension)
				.Where(n => !string.IsNullOrEmpty(n))
				.Select(n => n!)
				.OrderBy(n => n, StringComparer.OrdinalIgnoreCase)
				.ToList();
			_maps = list.ToImmutableArray();
			_mapChoices = new[] { RandomMapChoice }.Concat(_maps).ToImmutableArray();
			// 恢复上次地图：本进程内上次选中的（等价原版常驻对话框）→ CSBotConfig.vdf
			// 里的跨重启记忆（原版 CZ 同款文件/键名）；都没有、或那张图已不在列表时
			// 回到"< 随机地图 >"——原版下拉的默认选中项就是第 0 项随机地图
			_selectedMap ??= s_lastMap;
			_selectedMap ??= BotConfigVdf.GetValue("map");
			_mapIndex = _selectedMap is { } m && m != RandomMapChoice
				? _mapChoices.IndexOf(m, StringComparer.OrdinalIgnoreCase)
				: 0;
			if (_mapIndex < 0)
				_mapIndex = 0;
			_selectedMap = _mapChoices[_mapIndex];
		}
		catch (Exception ex)
		{
			// 地图目录枚举失败不影响窗口其余功能
			GoldSrcAvalonia.Log?.Invoke($"NewGameForm.LoadMaps failed: {ex.Message}");
		}
	}

	void OnMapSelected(Avalonia.Controls.SelectionChangedEventArgs e)
	{
		_selectedMap = SelectedLabel(e);
	}

	static string? SelectedLabel(Avalonia.Controls.SelectionChangedEventArgs e) =>
		e.AddedItems.Count > 0 ? e.AddedItems[0]?.ToString() : null;

	void OnCameraSelected(Avalonia.Controls.SelectionChangedEventArgs e) =>
		_cameraIndex = IndexOfValue(CameraLabels, SelectedLabel(e), _cameraIndex);

	void OnDifficultySelected(Avalonia.Controls.SelectionChangedEventArgs e) =>
		_difficultyIndex = IndexOfValue(DifficultyLabels, SelectedLabel(e), _difficultyIndex);

	void OnTeamSelected(Avalonia.Controls.SelectionChangedEventArgs e) =>
		_teamIndex = IndexOfValue(TeamLabels, SelectedLabel(e), _teamIndex);

	void OnChatterSelected(Avalonia.Controls.SelectionChangedEventArgs e) =>
		_chatterIndex = IndexOfValue(ChatterLabels, SelectedLabel(e), _chatterIndex);

	void Start()
	{
		// 没有任何真实地图时原版 GetMapString 返回 NULL，这里同样不动作
		if (_maps.Length == 0)
			return;
		// 与原版一致（ServerPage::GetMapString @0x206B0）：选中"< 随机地图 >"时
		// 在真实地图里均匀随机取一张，选中态本身保持随机地图
		var map = _selectedMap == RandomMapChoice
			? _maps[Random.Shared.Next(_maps.Length)]
			: _selectedMap;
		if (string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(map))
			return;

		// 与原版一致（组合命令 @0x98010）：引擎侧参数先发、map 收尾。
		// maxplayers/hostname/sv_password/sv_lan 都是引擎注册的，主菜单时已存在
		EngineCommands.ClientCmd($"maxplayers {(int)Math.Round(_maxPlayers ?? 16)}");
		EngineCommands.SetCvar("hostname", _hostname?.Trim() ?? "");
		EngineCommands.SetCvar("sv_password", _password?.Trim() ?? "");
		EngineCommands.SetCvarFloat("sv_use_steam_networking", _steamNetworking == true ? 1 : 0);
		EngineCommands.SetCvarFloat("sv_lan", _steamNetworking == true ? 0 : 1);
		EngineCommands.ClientCmd($"map {map}");

		// mp_* 由游戏 DLL（mp.dll）注册，而 mp.dll 要到 map 起服务器时才加载——
		// 在 map 之前下发会被引擎当 unknown command 丢弃（"第一局 800、第二局才生效"的根源）。
		// 与原版一致（0x1F482-0x1F48F）：map 后紧跟两个 wait，把下面的命令推迟到
		// 服务器已启动、mp.dll 注册完 cvar 之后执行，第一局即生效
		EngineCommands.ClientCmd("wait\nwait\n");

		EngineCommands.SetCvarFloat("mp_timelimit", ParseNum(_timelimit, 20));
		EngineCommands.SetCvarFloat("mp_winlimit", ParseNum(_winlimit, 0));
		EngineCommands.SetCvarFloat("mp_maxrounds", ParseNum(_maxrounds, 0));
		EngineCommands.SetCvarFloat("mp_roundtime", (float)Math.Round(_roundtime ?? 5, 2));
		EngineCommands.SetCvarFloat("mp_freezetime", (float)Math.Round(_freezetime ?? 6));
		EngineCommands.SetCvarFloat("mp_buytime", ParseNum(_buytime, 1.5f));
		EngineCommands.SetCvarFloat("mp_startmoney", (float)Math.Round(_startmoney ?? 800));
		EngineCommands.SetCvarFloat("mp_footsteps", _footsteps == true ? 1 : 0);
		EngineCommands.SetCvarFloat("mp_forcecamera", _cameraIndex);
		EngineCommands.SetCvarFloat("mp_fadetoblack", _fadetoblack == true ? 1 : 0);
		EngineCommands.SetCvarFloat("mp_friendlyfire", _friendlyFire == true ? 1 : 0);
		EngineCommands.SetCvarFloat("mp_tkpunish", _tkpunish == true ? 1 : 0);
		EngineCommands.SetCvarFloat("mp_autokick", _autokick == true ? 1 : 0);
		EngineCommands.SetCvarFloat("mp_hostagepenalty", ParseNum(_hostagepenalty, 5));
		EngineCommands.SetCvarFloat("mp_flashlight", _flashlight == true ? 1 : 0);

		// 机器人：bot_* 也归 mp.dll 注册，跟着上面这批延后到开局之后。
		// bot_quota 排最后——服务器（CBotManager::Update 每帧补名额）按已生效的
		// 难度/阵营/武器设置补满；数量为 0 时只关名额，不把十几条 bot_* 刷进控制台
		foreach (var (cvar, value) in BotSettings())
		{
			if (cvar != "bot_quota" && (_botQuota ?? 0) <= 0)
				continue;
			EngineCommands.SetCvar(cvar, value);
		}

		// 与原版一致（WriteGameplaySettings @0x1fef0）：开局时把控件值写回 settings.scr，
		// 下次创建对话框（含重启游戏）从这里回读——这就是原版“记住上次设置”的全部来源
		SettingsScr.SetValue("hostname", _hostname?.Trim() ?? "");
		SettingsScr.SetValue("maxplayers", ((int)Math.Round(_maxPlayers ?? 16)).ToString());
		SettingsScr.SetValue("sv_password", _password?.Trim() ?? "");
		SettingsScr.SetValue("mp_timelimit", NumText(ParseNum(_timelimit, 20)));
		SettingsScr.SetValue("mp_winlimit", NumText(ParseNum(_winlimit, 0)));
		SettingsScr.SetValue("mp_maxrounds", NumText(ParseNum(_maxrounds, 0)));
		SettingsScr.SetValue("mp_roundtime", NumText((float)Math.Round(_roundtime ?? 5, 2)));
		SettingsScr.SetValue("mp_freezetime", NumText((float)Math.Round(_freezetime ?? 6)));
		SettingsScr.SetValue("mp_buytime", NumText(ParseNum(_buytime, 1.5f)));
		SettingsScr.SetValue("mp_startmoney", NumText((float)Math.Round(_startmoney ?? 800)));
		SettingsScr.SetValue("mp_footsteps", _footsteps == true ? "1" : "0");
		SettingsScr.SetValue("mp_forcecamera", _cameraIndex.ToString());
		SettingsScr.SetValue("mp_fadetoblack", _fadetoblack == true ? "1" : "0");
		SettingsScr.SetValue("mp_friendlyfire", _friendlyFire == true ? "1" : "0");
		SettingsScr.SetValue("mp_tkpunish", _tkpunish == true ? "1" : "0");
		SettingsScr.SetValue("mp_autokick", _autokick == true ? "1" : "0");
		SettingsScr.SetValue("mp_hostagepenalty", NumText(ParseNum(_hostagepenalty, 5)));
		SettingsScr.SetValue("mp_flashlight", _flashlight == true ? "1" : "0");

		// 地图记忆：进程内 static 记选中项（可能是"随机地图"，等价原版常驻对话框）；
		// CSBotConfig.vdf 跨重启存解析后的具体地图（原版 CZ 语义——Start 时随机已定型）
		s_lastMap = _selectedMap;
		BotConfigVdf.SetValue("map", map);
		BotConfigVdf.SetValue("steamnetworking", _steamNetworking == true ? "1" : "0");
		// 机器人记忆：写进原版 bot 配置的同一份文件，键名用 cvar 名，
		// 与上面下发的表一一对应
		foreach (var (cvar, value) in BotSettings())
			BotConfigVdf.SetValue(cvar, value);
	}

	/// <summary>机器人项 → (cvar 名, 值)；下发和写存档共用这一张表</summary>
	List<(string Cvar, string Value)> BotSettings() => new()
	{
		("bot_difficulty", _difficultyIndex.ToString()),
		("bot_join_team", TeamValues[_teamIndex]),
		("bot_chatter", ChatterValues[_chatterIndex]),
		("bot_prefix", _botPrefix?.Trim() ?? ""),
		("bot_join_after_player", Bit(_botJoinAfterPlayer)),
		("bot_auto_vacate", Bit(_botAutoVacate)),
		("bot_defer_to_human", Bit(_botDeferToHuman)),
		("bot_allow_pistols", Bit(_botAllowPistols)),
		("bot_allow_shotguns", Bit(_botAllowShotguns)),
		("bot_allow_sub_machine_guns", Bit(_botAllowSubMachineGuns)),
		("bot_allow_rifles", Bit(_botAllowRifles)),
		("bot_allow_machine_guns", Bit(_botAllowMachineGuns)),
		("bot_allow_snipers", Bit(_botAllowSnipers)),
		("bot_allow_grenades", Bit(_botAllowGrenades)),
		("bot_allow_shield", Bit(_botAllowShield)),
		("bot_allow_rogues", Bit(_botAllowRogues)),
		("bot_quota", BotQuotaText),
	};

	static string Bit(bool? v) => v == true ? "1" : "0";
}
